3178-  configuration does not match the invariant claim's left-hand side closely
3179-  enough for the claim to apply, so the prover expands another iteration. See
3180:  [circularity debugging](../shared/kprove-debug-troubleshoot/circularity-not-applying.md).
3181:- **A helper rule is in the spec module instead of `verification.k`.** Plain `rule` statements in the spec module are a K compiler error; only `claim`s and `[simplification]` rules are allowed there.
