+  --definition /tmp/audit-work/reviewer-runtime-kompiled
+```
+
+It exited 0 with final `<k> .K </k>`, `<exc> NoExc </exc>`, and exit code 0.
+The tests cover the three examples, a loop/ceil boundary, `[[1]]`, an empty
+grid, and an empty row.
+
+Evidence:
